660 0 obj
  << /ActualText (UI\057UX Designer with experience designing and delivering digital experiences for large\055scale federal platforms at IBM\054 supporting agencies including FEMA\054 GSA\054 and the Department of Veterans Affairs\056 Skilled at translating complex workflows and data\055heavy systems into user friendly design with a strong foundation in visual design and a focus on compliance with USWDS and Section 508 standards\056 Passionate about creating experiences that are not only functional\054 but meaningful for the people who use them\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
