670 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Delivered design solutions across federal agencies including FEMA\054 GSA\054 and the Department of Veterans Affairs\056\nClient\072 Federal Emergency Management Agency \050FEMA\051\nDesigned and streamlined data\055heavy workflows for FEMA Risk Analysis platforms\054 transforming fragmented processes into modern\054 intuitive experiences that reduced user friction and improved operational clarity\nLed UX modernization efforts across FEMA platforms\054 including interactive maps\054 dashboards\054 and request systems\054 collaborating with cross\055functional stakeholders and building scalable design systems aligned with USWDS standards\nClient\072 Department of Veterans Affairs \050VA\051\nServed as the sole designer on a cross\055functional team to design a Veteran benefits submission platform\054 owning UX from wireframing through final design specs\nSimplified complex\054 multi\055step benefit\055claiming workflows for a diverse user base\054  including users with limited digital access or experience\054 by breaking tasks into manageable steps and embedding contextual guidance throughout\nClient\072 General Services Administration \050GSA\051\nDelivered end\055to\055end visual designs for SAM\056gov\054 a federal procurement platform serving 500\054000\053 entities\054 producing UI assets across desktop and mobile in compliance with Section 508 accessibility standards\nBuilt and maintained a standardized component library of UI\057UX elements across SAM systems\054 ensuring design consistency\054 reducing ambiguity\054 and improving accessibility at scale)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 671 0 R
     /Pg 656 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

